 Returns `204 No Content` on success.
 
+## Board Publications
+
+Publishing a board creates a secret public URL (`/:account_slug/public/boards/:key`) that lets anyone see the board, its columns and its published cards without signing in. Only account admins can publish or unpublish boards.
+
+### `POST /:account_slug/boards/:board_id/publication`
+
+Publishes the board. Publishing an already published board keeps the existing public URL.
+
+__Response:__
+
+Returns `201 Created` with the board in the same shape as `GET /:account_slug/boards/:board_id`, including its `public_url`:
+
+```json
+{
+  "id": "03f5v9zkft4hj9qq0lsn9ohcm",
+  "name": "Fizzy",
+  "all_access": true,
+  "created_at": "2025-12-05T19:36:35.534Z",
+  "auto_postpone_period_in_days": 30,
+  "url": "http://app.fizzy.localhost:3006/897362094/boards/03f5v9zkft4hj9qq0lsn9ohcm",
+  "public_url": "http://app.fizzy.localhost:3006/897362094/public/boards/H3ynK1pS6Q9EFbNpsrcwbMCn",
+  "creator": {
+    "id": "03f5v9zjw7pz8717a4no1h8a7",
+    "name": "David Heinemeier Hansson",
+    "role": "owner",
+    "active": true,
+    "email_address": "david@example.com",
+    "created_at": "2025-12-05T19:36:35.401Z",
+    "url": "http://app.fizzy.localhost:3006/897362094/users/03f5v9zjw7pz8717a4no1h8a7"
+  }
+}
+```
+
+### `DELETE /:account_slug/boards/:board_id/publication`
+
+Unpublishes the board. The public URL stops working immediately.
+
+__Response:__
+
+Returns `204 No Content` on success.
+
 ## Board Accesses
 
 Board accesses let you see who has access to a board and their involvement level (watching or access only). Any board member can view this information.
diff --git a/test/controllers/boards/publications_controller_test.rb b/test/controllers/boards/publications_controller_test.rb
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..81cb752
--- /dev/null
+++ b/test/controllers/boards/publications_controller_test.rb
@@ -0,0 +1,105 @@
+require "test_helper"
+
+class Boards::PublicationsControllerTest < ActionDispatch::IntegrationTest
+  setup do
+    sign_in_as :kevin
+    @board = boards(:writebook)
+  end
+
+  test "create" do
+    post board_publication_path(@board)
+
+    assert_redirected_to edit_board_path(@board)
+    assert @board.reload.published?
+  end
+
+  test "create as turbo stream" do
+    post board_publication_path(@board, format: :turbo_stream)
+
+    assert_response :success
+    assert @board.reload.published?
+    assert_turbo_stream action: :replace, target: dom_id(@board, :publication) do
+      assert_select "input[readonly][value=?]", public_board_url(@board.publication)
+      assert_select "button", text: /Unpublish/
+    end
+  end
+
+  test "create as JSON" do
+    post board_publication_path(@board), as: :json
+
+    assert_response :created
+    assert @board.reload.published?
+    assert_equal public_board_url(@board.publication), @response.parsed_body["public_url"]
+  end
+
+  test "create is idempotent" do
+    @board.publish
+    key = @board.publication.key
+
+    post board_publication_path(@board), as: :json
+
+    assert_response :created
+    assert_equal key, @board.reload.publication.key
+  end
+
+  test "destroy" do
+    @board.publish
+
+    delete board_publication_path(@board)
+
+    assert_redirected_to edit_board_path(@board)
+    assert_not @board.reload.published?
+  end
+
+  test "destroy as turbo stream" do
+    @board.publish
+
+    delete board_publication_path(@board, format: :turbo_stream)
+
+    assert_response :success
+    assert_not @board.reload.published?
+    assert_turbo_stream action: :replace, target: dom_id(@board, :publication) do
+      assert_select "button", text: /Publish this board/
+      assert_select "input[readonly]", count: 0
+    end
+  end
+
+  test "destroy as JSON" do
+    @board.publish
+
+    delete board_publication_path(@board), as: :json
+
+    assert_response :no_content
+    assert_not @board.reload.published?
+  end
+
+  test "non-admins cannot publish a board, even if they created it" do
